---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Verdant Grove Studio"
  description="Our story, philosophy, and design approach to intentional outdoor living through raised beds"
>
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container about-hero-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>Thoughtful gardens for everyday life</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Verdant Grove Studio began with the belief that gardens should support everyday life,
        not become another overwhelming project. We create spaces that are productive,
        restorative, and designed to evolve beautifully through the seasons.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-section" id="story">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Your Story</h2>
      <p>
        Verdant Grove started in the in-between moments: noticing neighbors who wanted to grow
        food but felt unsure where to begin, and families who loved the idea of a garden but did
        not have time for trial and error. The studio grew from a simple goal to make growing
        feel possible, elegant, and deeply connected to home.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-section muted" id="philosophy">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Your Philosophy</h2>
      <p class="subhead">Not just landscaping. Intentional outdoor living.</p>
      <p>
        We design spaces that invite you outside more often: to clip herbs before dinner, pick
        flowers on a slow morning, and move through the seasons with rhythm instead of rush.
        Beauty matters. Ease matters. Daily use matters.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-section" id="approach">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Your Design Approach</h2>
      <p class="subhead">Structure + beauty + usability</p>
      <div class="pillars">
        <article>
          <h3>Structure</h3>
          <p>
            Clear layouts, intentional pathways, and defined planting zones that keep the garden
            organized and easy to maintain.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Beauty</h3>
          <p>
            Layered textures, seasonal color, and balanced forms so your garden feels as refined
            as the rest of your home.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Usability</h3>
          <p>
            Practical placement, comfortable access, and planting choices that match how your
            household actually cooks, gathers, and lives.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-section muted" id="raised-beds">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Why Raised Beds</h2>
      <div class="reasons">
        <article>
          <h3>Accessibility</h3>
          <p>
            Raised beds reduce bending and strain, making gardening more comfortable for all ages
            and stages of life.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Aesthetics</h3>
          <p>
            They add beautiful structure to the landscape and create a clean, intentional visual
            language in the yard.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Productivity</h3>
          <p>
            Better soil control, improved drainage, and focused planting plans help gardens produce
            more with less overwhelm.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    padding: var(--spacing-2xl) var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-xl);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 85% 20%, rgba(192, 123, 90, 0.3) 0 22%, transparent 24%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 10% 80%, rgba(138, 179, 160, 0.24) 0 26%, transparent 28%),
      var(--color-light-bg);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .about-hero-inner {
    max-width: 860px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .about-hero h1 {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
    max-width: 18ch;
  }

  .lead {
    max-width: 70ch;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .about-section {
    padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .about-section.muted {
    background-color: var(--color-light-bg);
  }

  .about-section h2 {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  .about-section .subhead {
    color: var(--color-accent-2);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  .about-section > .container > p {
    max-width: 72ch;
  }

  .pillars,
  .reasons {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--spacing-md);
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    margin-top: var(--spacing-md);
  }

  .pillars article,
  .reasons article {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-white);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: var(--spacing-md);
  }

  .pillars h3,
  .reasons h3 {
    color: var(--color-hero);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .pillars,
    .reasons {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>